<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-STEAUA'S BACIU SENT OFF.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-STEAUA'S BACIU SENT OFF.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Marius Baciu of Steaua Bucharest was sent off for a foul in the 28th minute of a European Cup Champions' League Group B match against Atletico Madrid.</p>
</text>
